# Carbuncle Debacle (battlefield.carbuncle_debacle_cloister_of_storms, CloisterOfStorms): the exit. The char enters
# arena 1, then Lightning_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield: 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its
# update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss
# event). Then LP_Entrance, no trade: the clearance is kept (effect 254, power 449), so the override's non-registrant
# arm (isValidEntry) passes: the menu 32000 again.
lists CloisterOfStorms/LP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfStorms/LP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfStorms/Lightning_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfStorms/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfStorms/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=536.6,-14.9,493.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle accepted
charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 3
item LightningPendulum
login
trade LP_Entrance LightningPendulum x1      # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=17                  # index 1, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Lightning_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Lightning_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp 536.6,-14.9,493.0 CloisterOfStorms
trigger LP_Entrance                     # the clearance kept: the helper arm: the menu 32000 again
